  "description": "Returning to college after a break, Shin Jeong-woo unexpectedly reunites with Yoon San-yeong, the upperclassman he once admired in high school. As they grow closer, San-yeong keeps flirting with him, and before long, the two end up spending the night together and start dating. But the more Jeong-woo gets to know San-yeong, the more he feels like he’s dealing with someone completely different from the person he remembered. Conflicted, Jeong-woo confides in a friend about their relationship. Yet the moment his friend hears San-yeong’s name, he explodes in anger, calling him the “crazy guy from the English Literature Department.” What secret side of Yoon San-yeong is Jeong-woo still unaware of?!\n\n**Original Webtoon:**  \n[Bomtoon](https://www.bomtoon.com/detail/Everything), [RIDI](https://ridibooks.com/books/1561006311), [Lezhin](https://www.lezhin.com/ko/comic/reason_for_almost), [Bookcube](https://www.bookcube.com/detail.asp?series_num=920018570&page=buy), [MrBlue](https://www.mrblue.com/comic/ifcm_0116), Zzangcomic",
